        # - Adds Lapis to the user `PATH` environment variable.
        # - Configures file associations and shell completions for PowerShell.
        #
        # #### Method 2: Scoop Package Manager
        # If you use Scoop for Windows development tooling:
        # ```powershell
        # scoop install crystal radare2 make git
        # # Run lapis global installer
        # .\bin\lapis.exe install
        # ```
        #
        # #### Method 3: Global Path Linking via Lapis CLI
        # If you compiled Lapis from source:
        # ```powershell
        # bin\lapis install --force
        # ```
        #
