        #
        # - **Q: Can I use MSVC instead of MinGW-w64 on Windows?**
        #   A: Yes. Set CXX=cl in your environment or Makefile, though g++ is the default tested bridge compiler.
        #
        # - **Q: Where does lapis install place the executable?**
        #   A: On Windows: %LOCALAPPDATA%\Programs\Lapis\bin. On Linux/macOS: /usr/local/bin or ~/.local/bin.
